   "rating": 23,
   "date": "2006-12-13T07:13:01-06:00",
   "body": "The murlocs are located upstream the river and to the northeast.  They are easily spotted by their island-style huts, and the fins don't take too long to drop but the murlocs are very difficult to face alone at level 10.  Tough quest imho.",
