   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2006-10-06T18:08:52-05:00",
   "body": "possibly the most frustrating quest in the first zone.\n\ndrop rate is about 20%, which means you need to kill forty Murlocs.  the Murlocs are in two areas, one on the west side of the lake and one along the shorline between the pumpkin patch and the landing.  the former is truly awful because the Murlocs are easily aggrod in groups of two, and there is a lot of competition.  so i suggest the shoreline (fewer murlocs but they are not in groups and basically zero competition).\n\nbut most importantly, i suggest skipping this quest altogether.",
   "replies": []
  },
